- Budget calculations are correct and tested.
- Tasks and deadlines behave correctly.
- Vendor and guest records respect authorization.
- Gemini generates useful, validated planning proposals when configured.
- AI failure does not break ordinary event management.
- The interface is polished and responsive on mobile and desktop.
- The PWA manifest, service worker, and offline behavior are implemented and verified to the extent supported by the environment.
- Core accessibility requirements are addressed.
- Security-sensitive operations are validated server-side.
